  "subdivision_of_building": "The mural will be painted on a 30 metre section of the large exterior wall on the street/ground level immediately beneath Woodhall Flats on Robert Street, Regent's Park Estate, NW1 3JP. \n\nThe proposal will not interfere with or affect any part of the residential building. The mural will include nine illustrated Dibond panels which form part of the full design of the mural. Each panel will have radius corners and will be mounted onto the wall using blocks. The painted background for the mural will cover the area from ground level up to 195cm in height and 30 metres in width.",
